flowchart LR
 P[Scope + pinned target] --> C[Prior coverage + provenance audit]
 C --> R[Readiness: bridge, owned windows, descendant accounting]
 R --> U[Repeatable input + refresh/state]
 R --> D[Display/export color]
 R --> T[Correlated Canvas transport]
 T --> L[R1 release failure + R2 reuse/completion]
 U --> V[Separate evidence verifier]
 D --> V
 L --> V
 C --> Q[50-item graph quality review]
 V --> S[Behavior-only specification]
 Q --> S
 S --> F[Separate spec/provenance reviewer]
 F --> H[Hashed allowlist package]
 H --> G{Fresh context + isolated workspace}
 G --> I[Original implementation]
 I --> B[Independent platform parity]
 V --> M1[Full milestone 1 contract review]
 B --> M2[Full milestone 2 contract review]
 M1 --> M2
